The '''Personal Bank''' is an Upgrade that allows the player to access the [[Bank]] remotely.

== Interface ==
{{:Bank/UI}}

== Usage ==
The '''Personal Bank''' can be accessed through the {{Item|SkyBlock Menu}} after reaching {{CollectionLink|Emerald VI}}. It allows the player to access the {{zone|Bank}}'s interface from anywhere in [[SkyBlock]]. The '''Personal Bank''' has a default cooldown of {{Green|1}} hour, and during this time cannot be accessed. The cooldown can be reset by talking to the [[Banker]], [[Banker Broadjaw]] or [[Banker Barry]] and can be reduced by talking to [[Guy]].

If the player has a [[Booster Cookie]] active, the '''Personal Bank''' can also be accessed through the {{code|/bank}} command.

{{Gamemode|Bingo}} players automatically have the '''Personal Bank''' unlocked with no cooldown.

